{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43321","headline":"贡院楼北新栽小松 · 钱衆仲","name":"贡院楼北新栽小松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱此凌霜操，移来独占春。\n贞心初得地，劲节始依人。\n笼月烟犹薄，当轩色转新。\n枝低无宿羽，叶静不留尘。\n每与芝兰近，常慙雨露均。\n幸因逢顾盼，生植及兹辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱衆仲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}